### 🔧 IaC Files Details

**main.bicep** (Main Template)
- Orchestrates all resource deployments
- Manages networking and security configurations
- Configures Application Insights and Log Analytics
- Outputs connection details and resource IDs

**mysql.bicep** (MySQL Module)
- Deploys MySQL Flexible Server
- Creates railwaydb database
- Configures firewall rules for Azure IPs
- Auto-scaling and backup enabled

**parameters.bicepparam** (Parameters)
- Centralized configuration values
- Easy to update for different environments
- Change password before deployment

**deploy.bat / deploy.sh** (Deployment Scripts)
- Automates Azure CLI authentication
- Validates Bicep templates
- Creates resource group
- Executes Bicep deployment
- Saves outputs for reference

---

